Z||000000||Gerald||10-16-2001||11:16 PM||||OK so tonight I'm leaving the fiero club meeting here in Edmonton. Made a ass of my self in the process. Stalled. But I'm still getting used to the new clutch. Any way after a disgracefully exit I felt I needed to prove myself to......well myself. So I go hunting. All I find is some guy in a Pontiac 6000. Not what I hope for but it'll do. I kill him once. Then again and again. Every red light I hit he was right beside me. He just wouldn't give up. Had some determination I guess.WE had 3 redlight starts and 2 rolling starts. I just don't see why he would want to humiliate himself over and over again. Weird<P>------------------<BR>87 coupe 5 spd||||reg||1
